    "rationale": "From WORKSTATION5, pgustavo wrote iertutil.dll into C:\\Program Files\\Internet Explorer on WORKSTATION6 over the C$ share; Internet Explorer then started over DCOM (-Embedding), loaded the planted DLL and spawned notepad.exe, which connects to 10.10.10.5:80. DCOM lateral movement with a DLL hijack delivered an implant; isolate WORKSTATION6."
